{
  "bookId": "hero-211002",
  "id": "bond-27503",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27503001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "准备完毕，要上了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27503002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "要、要开始了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27503003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "沉静下来，保持专注。\n如今的磨砺，将会是你宝贵的人生财富。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27503004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "相信我的判断，此战必捷！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27503005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可是万一爆炸，或者起火......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27503006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "或许会，但我们必须勇敢面对这一切。\n我向你保证，「玛尔斯之盾」会挡住飞向你的所有威胁。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27503007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "......我想我准备好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27503008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "听我指令，开火！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27503009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "做得很好，我为你感到骄傲！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27503010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我真的做到了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27503011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "现在把火调小些，土豆块下锅，翻炒。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27503012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "梅根闻到了吗，好香啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27503013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "......嗯，就是这种香味。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27503014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "和院长奶奶做的炒土豆，一模一样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
